<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-004" chapter-id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun" source-id="s-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun-ws1561627">
  <p id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月甲午，<persName id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p001:m0006" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">皇帝</persName>即位于南郊</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">追尊皇考曰<persName id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0005" ref="egx_xax_4ic">宣皇帝</persName>，皇妣曰<persName id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0012" ref="pib_5me_1wm_A">孝皇后</persName>，陵曰永安。妃曰<persName id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0023" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AA">昭皇后</persName>，陵曰泰安。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊戌，以荊州刺史<persName id="c-nanshi-004-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p003:m0008" ref="ijh_3fs_6u2">嶷</persName>為尚書令</p>
</text>
